Third-party files in this repository keep their own licences:

- src/assets/fonts/ and src/assets/og-fonts/: Space Grotesk and DM Sans,
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see the OFL-*.txt files next to them).
- public/data/tokens-gpt2.bin: built from OpenAI's GPT-2 vocabulary and merges,
  MIT License (the full text is embedded in the file).
- public/data/early-vectors.*: derived from GloVe 6B (Pennington, Socher &
  Manning), Public Domain Dedication and License v1.0.
- public/data/tokens-words.txt: the ENABLE word list, public domain.
- src/data/gpt2-challenge.json: next-word probabilities recorded from GPT-2
  small (OpenAI, MIT License).
